## A streamlined .gitignore for modern .NET projects
## including temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular .NET tools. If you are
## developing with Visual Studio, the VS .gitignore
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore
## has more thorough IDE-specific entries.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore

# Release artifacts (pack-macos.sh --dmg, and whatever the Windows installer produces)
dist/

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet Symbol Packages
*.snupkg

# dotenv environment variables file
.env

# Others
~$*
*~
CodeCoverage/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

# Visual Studio / Rider local state and per-user settings
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
.claude/
.DS_Store

# ── 设计文档不进 git（用户 2026-09-15 定：仓库里只放代码和 README.md）──────────
# 本地留着照常用，只是不跟着仓库走。⚠️ 后果是 clone 下来不带这几份，
# 换机器要自己拷过去。
CLAUDE.md
DESIGN.md
DECISIONS.md

# 签名材料：证书、私钥、指纹。⚠️ 私钥绝不能进 git
signing/
